          { term: 'Speaking in front of groups', desc: 'Speaking or presenting in front of large groups, appearing more confident and releasing the tension.' },
          { term: 'Insecurities', desc: 'Gain more trust in yourself and how you come across.' },
        ],
      },
      {
        title: 'Decisions',
        items: [
          { term: 'Helplessness', desc: 'Move from a sense of being stuck back into taking action.' },
