        ],
      },
      {
        title: 'Work & career',
        items: [
          { term: 'Performance pressure', desc: 'Deal more calmly with high expectations and lower the pressure.' },
          { term: 'Time pressure', desc: 'Handle tasks and deadlines more calmly and in a structured way.' },
          { term: 'Burn-out prevention', desc: 'Counteract early and protect your limits. Only suitable as supportive guidance, it does not replace medical or therapeutic treatment.' },
        ],
      },
      {
        title: 'Other concerns',
        items: [
          { term: 'Self-discipline', desc: 'Stay on track and follow through on your plans consistently.' },
          { term: 'Lack of drive', desc: 'Find new motivation and get back into action.' },
          { term: 'Self-worth', desc: 'Recognise your own worth and stand more firmly in yourself.' },
          'and more',
        ],
      },
    ],
    placeholderTitle: 'Your topic',
    placeholderText:
      'As individual as people are, so different are their concerns. If your topic is not here, just reach out and we will look at your path together.',
    disclaimerText:
      'Coaching is not training, therapy or medical treatment. It is therefore not suitable for clinically relevant topics. Coaching is also not purely the transfer of knowledge. Psychoeducation is used in a targeted and practical way. Coaching primarily serves goal achievement and lasting behaviour change with the help of psychologically grounded methods.',
    uspEyebrow: 'The difference',
    uspTitle: 'Why grounded methods achieve more',
    uspLead:
      'Whether group settings or unstructured individual sessions – much often stays on the surface. I support you on a psychologically and scientifically grounded basis, so that you truly reach your goal for good.',
    groupTag: 'Group coaching',
    groupTitle: 'Tips in a group',
    groupText:
      'Quick tips in a crowded setting. Afterwards you are left alone with your topic again.',
    groupCons: [
      'Personal issues in an open round',
      'Your topic does not get the space it needs',
      'Hardly any individual focus',
      'Comparison with others can add to your burden',
      'Left on your own after the session',
    ],
